1
00:00:00,269 --> 00:00:04,569
Is Ernest Goes to Jail the only
prison movie you've seen?

2
00:00:04,573 --> 00:00:07,373
(Sheldon:)It scared me straight, Leonard.

3
00:00:07,376 --> 00:00:09,146
(knock on door)

4
00:00:09,144 --> 00:00:11,374
(Barry:)Hey, I've been thinking.

5
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,080
(Barry:)I was being petty.

6
00:00:13,082 --> 00:00:15,112
You can have my helium.

7
00:00:15,584 --> 00:00:17,284
(Leonard:)Thank you, Barry.

8
00:00:17,286 --> 00:00:20,256
(Barry:)But you have to add my name
to your paper.

9
00:00:21,257 --> 00:00:22,627
(Sheldon:)That's preposterous.

10
00:00:22,625 --> 00:00:23,955
(Barry:)I don't know, seems fair.

11
00:00:23,959 --> 00:00:25,559
(Barry:)You can't do it without me.

12
00:00:26,562 --> 00:00:27,592
(Leonard:)Can you give us a minute?

13
00:00:27,596 --> 00:00:28,726
(Barry:)Take your time.

14
00:00:28,731 --> 00:00:31,961
(Barry:)I'll walk out backwards
for dramatic effect.

15
00:00:38,474 --> 00:00:40,904
(Man:)I don't like
being extorted like this.

16
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:42,780
(Sheldon:)Especially by him of all people.

17
00:00:42,778 --> 00:00:45,848
(Leonard:)Me neither, but what
other choice do we have?

18
00:00:45,848 --> 00:00:48,918
(Leonard:)I promise this is the last time.

19
00:00:56,098 --> 00:00:58,128
(Leonard:)It says right here
on Wikipedia.

20
00:00:58,134 --> 00:01:00,564
"A Mexican standoff is
a confrontation between

21
00:01:00,570 --> 00:01:01,840
at least three parties."

22
00:01:01,838 --> 00:01:03,908
(Sheldon:)How can you trust Wikipedia

23
00:01:03,906 --> 00:01:07,746
if they use "between"
to refer to three parties?

24
00:01:08,810 --> 00:01:11,150
(Helium Man:)They should've used
"among," right?

25
00:01:13,148 --> 00:01:17,218
Or "amongst," if they were
feeling whimsically archaic.

26
00:01:17,220 --> 00:01:18,990
(Sheldon:)All right,
enough with the chitchat.

27
00:01:18,988 --> 00:01:21,858
(Helium Man:)Are we gonna watch
Ernest Goes to Jail or not?

28
00:01:21,858 --> 00:01:23,258
(Sheldon:)Absolutely.

29
00:01:23,259 --> 00:01:25,389
(Sheldon:)But don't be surprised
if this movie sets you

30
00:01:25,395 --> 00:01:28,965
(Sheldon:)on the straight and narrow.
I am open to change.

